"""Perspective variants of the 14 demo dilemmas (w2schar-mini/src/csm/prompts.py QUESTION_SITUATIONS).

actor = the original 1st-person text. observer = same facts, 3rd person ("what should it do?").
other_seat = same facts, 1st person, from the counterpart affected by the actor's choice; only where one exists.
The verdict on the act should match across seats; advice may differ by role. Drafted by Claude (Pi, Opus 5.5) 2026-10-08.
"""

